{"id":"bs03","name":"Monthly Active Users","lang":"sql","entry":null,"params":[],"limit_s":10,"ordered":true,"desc":"<p>The growth team reports the monthly active users. You have two tables.</p>\n<p><b>users</b>: <code>user_id</code> (unique), <code>name</code> and <code>phone_num</code>.</p>\n<p><b>user_history</b>: one row per action of a user, with <code>user_id</code>, <code>date</code> (date) and <code>action</code>. A login is an action equal to <code>'logged_on'</code>; other actions (for example <code>'signed_up'</code>) are not logins.</p>\n<p>The report date is <code>2026-03-01</code>. A user is <b>active</b> if they logged in at least once during the 30 days before the report date: from <code>2026-01-30</code> to <code>2026-02-28</code>, both included.</p>\n<p>Your task is to return the columns <code>name</code>, <code>phone_num</code> and <code>last_login</code> (the latest login date of the user in this period) for every active user, sorted by <code>last_login</code> descending, then <code>name</code>.</p>\n<h4>Example</h4><p>Table <code>users</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>user_id</th><th>name</th><th>phone_num</th></tr><tr><td>jkog</td><td>Jing</td><td>202-555-0176</td></tr><tr><td>niceguy</td><td>Goodman</td><td>202-555-0174</td></tr><tr><td>sanhoo</td><td>Sanjay</td><td>202-555-0100</td></tr><tr><td>shaw123</td><td>Shaw</td><td>202-555-0111</td></tr></table></div><p>Table <code>user_history</code>:</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>user_id</th><th>date</th><th>action</th></tr><tr><td>shaw123</td><td>2026-02-20</td><td>logged_on</td></tr><tr><td>shaw123</td><td>2026-03-12</td><td>signed_up</td></tr><tr><td>sanhoo</td><td>2026-02-27</td><td>logged_on</td></tr><tr><td>sanhoo</td><td>2026-01-01</td><td>logged_on</td></tr><tr><td>niceguy</td><td>2026-01-22</td><td>logged_on</td></tr></table></div><p>the output should be</p><div class=\"tblw\"><table><tr><th>name</th><th>phone_num</th><th>last_login</th></tr><tr><td>Sanjay</td><td>202-555-0100</td><td>2026-02-27</td></tr><tr><td>Shaw</td><td>202-555-0111</td><td>2026-02-20</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"lim\"><b>[execution time limit]</b> 10 seconds (psql)<br><b>[memory limit]</b> 1 GB</div>","starter":"/* Write your PostgreSQL query here */\n","hints":["La fenêtre : date >= DATE '2026-03-01' - 30 AND date < DATE '2026-03-01'. Seule l'action 'logged_on' compte.","Toutes les colonnes du SELECT doivent être dans le GROUP BY ou dans un agrégat (MAX(date))."],"summary_fr":"Lister les utilisateurs qui se sont connectés (action logged_on) dans les 30 jours avant le 1er mars 2026, avec leur dernière connexion de cette période.","tags":["filtre de dates","GROUP BY","dépendance fonctionnelle"],"minutes":12,"source":"shawlu95/Beyond-LeetCode-SQL (MIT) · Monthly Active User","files":null,"visible":[{"input":{"tables":{"users":{"columns":[["user_id","VARCHAR(20)"],["name","VARCHAR(30)"],["phone_num","VARCHAR(20)"]],"rows":[["jkog","Jing","202-555-0176"],["niceguy","Goodman","202-555-0174"],["sanhoo","Sanjay","202-555-0100"],["shaw123","Shaw","202-555-0111"]]},"user_history":{"columns":[["user_id","VARCHAR(20)"],["date","DATE"],["action","VARCHAR(20)"]],"rows":[["shaw123","2026-02-20","logged_on"],["shaw123","2026-03-12","signed_up"],["sanhoo","2026-02-27","logged_on"],["sanhoo","2026-01-01","logged_on"],["niceguy","2026-01-22","logged_on"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["name","phone_num","last_login"],"rows":[["Sanjay","202-555-0100","2026-02-27"],["Shaw","202-555-0111","2026-02-20"]]}},{"input":{"tables":{"users":{"columns":[["user_id","VARCHAR(20)"],["name","VARCHAR(30)"],["phone_num","VARCHAR(20)"]],"rows":[["jkog","Jing","202-555-0176"],["niceguy","Goodman","202-555-0174"],["sanhoo","Sanjay","202-555-0100"]]},"user_history":{"columns":[["user_id","VARCHAR(20)"],["date","DATE"],["action","VARCHAR(20)"]],"rows":[["jkog","2026-01-30","logged_on"],["jkog","2026-01-29","logged_on"],["niceguy","2026-03-01","logged_on"],["sanhoo","2026-02-28","signed_up"],["sanhoo","2026-02-10","logged_on"]]}}},"expected":{"columns":["name","phone_num","last_login"],"rows":[["Sanjay","202-555-0100","2026-02-10"],["Jing","202-555-0176","2026-01-30"]]}}],"hidden_n":6,"hidden":"","solution":""}